---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ServicePricing from '../../../../components/ServicePricing.astro';
import { getServicePricing } from '../../../../data/service-prices';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const pricing = getServicePricing('washing-machine', 'sofia', lang);

const title = 'Washing Machine Repair in Sofia | In-Home Service RotoRem';
const description = 'Expert in-home washing machine repair and installation service in Sofia - Quality guarantee - All washing machine brands - Call now at 089 834 0982!';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white py-16 mb-16">
      <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          In-Home Washing Machine Repair and Installation in Sofia
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Professional washing machine repair in Sofia and nearby districts. Fast on-site service with a full workmanship guarantee.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Visit and diagnostics in Sofia - 30 EUR
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container max-w-4xl">

      <!-- Benefits Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why choose our washing machine repair service in Sofia?</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-blue-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-3">Same day visit</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-800">A technician can arrive the same day in most Sofia districts to diagnose and repair your washing machine on-site.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-green-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-green-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-900 mb-3">Repairs during the first visit</h3>
            <p class="text-green-800">We successfully complete 80% of repairs on the first visit thanks to well-stocked vans and genuine spare parts.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Warranty on workmanship</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-800">Every repair comes with a written warranty and a detailed report outlining the parts and labour performed.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-50 to-lime-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-lime-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-lime-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-lime-900 mb-3">Fair prices</h3>
            <p class="text-lime-800">Visit and diagnostics in Sofia - 30 EUR. Transparent pricing with no hidden fees.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Common Issues Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Common washing machine faults we solve in Sofia</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">1</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Washer will not drain</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">Clogged filters, broken pumps, or blocked hoses are the usual suspects. We troubleshoot and fix each component on-site.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">2</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Machine will not power on</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">From faulty control boards to damaged door locks and power issues, we run full diagnostics with professional equipment.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">3</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Loud vibration and noise</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">Uneven levelling, worn bearings, or faulty dampers cause excessive shaking. We balance the unit and replace worn parts.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">4</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Washer will not heat water</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">Heating elements and temperature sensors fail over time. We replace faulty heaters and calibrate sensors for efficient cycles.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {pricing && <ServicePricing pricing={pricing} accent="blue" />}

      <!-- Repair Process Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Washing machine repair process in Sofia</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">1</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">You call us</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Call 089 834 0982 to book washing machine repair in Sofia.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">2</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">We come to you</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Our technician arrives on time with all required tools and parts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">3</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">We repair</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">We diagnose the issue and repair your washing machine the same day whenever possible.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Service Areas Section -->
      <section class="mb-16 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Service coverage across Sofia</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          We cover every district of Sofia - from the historic centre to modern residential areas such as Lozenets, Mladost, Vitosha, Lyulin, and Studentski Grad.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-gray-700">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>City Center</li>
            <li>Lozenets</li>
            <li>Studentski Grad</li>
            <li>Iztok</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Mladost</li>
            <li>Druzhba</li>
            <li>Dianabad</li>
            <li>Vitosha</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Lyulin</li>
            <li>Nadezhda</li>
            <li>Ovcha Kupel</li>
            <li>Krasno Selo</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Need washing machine repair in Sofia?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-blue-100">Call now for fast on-site repair!</p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="text-blue-100">
          <p class="text-sm">
            Visit and diagnostics: Sofia - 30 EUR | Quality guarantee | Service in Sofia
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- SEO Content Section -->
  <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <p dir="ltr">When a washing machine does not start or begins running unstably, it immediately creates inconvenience at home. We provide fast and reliable in-home washing machine repair in Sofia and nearby areas, directly at your address, without unnecessary transport of the appliance. Our team responds quickly, diagnoses the issue on-site, and carries out the required repair or installation during a single visit whenever possible.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">What washing machine problems we repair in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Most washing machine faults can be solved quickly when diagnosed correctly. You can rely on us for effective repairs in all common situations where the washer does not work properly and affects laundry results.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Besides standard repairs, we also perform more specific work such as bearing replacement, drum repair, and control-system fault fixing. When needed, we also install washing machines, including proper leveling and safe connection to utility lines for long-term reliable operation.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">If you also have issues with other appliances, we provide full support. We also offer <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/dryer-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">dryer repair</a> and <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/dishwasher-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">dishwasher repair</a> in Sofia. You can review all services on our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/" style="text-decoration:none;">Sofia appliance service page</a>.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Brands of washing machines we service</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We work with all major manufacturers and know their specifics well. We repair Bosch, Whirlpool, Samsung, LG, AEG, Beko, and other brands, whether the appliance is a newer model or an older unit. Our experience helps us quickly identify the root cause and provide the right solution for your exact model.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Sofia districts we cover</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We service all Sofia districts and nearby areas up to around 20 km. We visit addresses in Mladost, Lyulin, Nadezhda, Druzhba, Studentski Grad, Lozenets, City Center, Manastirski Livadi, and other areas, with quick response and convenient booking times.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">How washing machine repair works</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">The process is designed to be clear and convenient. After your request, we schedule a suitable time for the visit. On-site, we run diagnostics to identify the exact cause of the problem. You then receive a clear quote with a final price.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Once approved, we start the repair immediately using quality parts and proper tools. After completion, we test the appliance in real conditions to ensure normal operation. This guarantees a fast, transparent service with no unnecessary delays.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Why choose RotoRem washing machine service in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Customers choose us when they need a reliable solution without wasting time. We have over 15 years of experience in home appliance repair and provide on-site service that saves effort and transport.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Every repair is carried out with attention to detail and according to the specific model. We work with clear pricing and no hidden fees, and we provide warranty for completed work. The combination of experience, fast response, and fair communication makes us a reliable choice for washing machine repair in Sofia.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>


